g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b6/cefrmgrlclqtf5gjg3lgljv02kycy98.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E7%96%BE%E8%88%9E%E8%BF%9E%E8%A2%AD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b6/cefrmgrlclqtf5gjg3lgljv02kycy98.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />疾舞连袭\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魅惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">魅惑</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">惊鸿之姿</font></span>]产生冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>。<br />✦个性[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蜂刺</font></span>]效果的伤害倍率翻倍。<br />✦对受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魅惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">魅惑</font></span></span>]类、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">受到持续伤害提高</span>]类敌人：物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，造成伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，受其伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦攻击拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]的敌人时，可施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">蜂刺</span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魅惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">魅惑</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">惊鸿之姿</font></span>]产生冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>。<br />✦个性[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蜂刺</font></span>]效果的伤害倍率翻倍。<br />✦对受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魅惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">魅惑</font></span></span>]类、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">受到持续伤害提高</span>]类敌人：物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，造成伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，受其伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦攻击拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]的敌人时，可施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">蜂刺</span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6